          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1080p at 30 fps is the best balance for talking-head work. Use about 4000 kbps for live platforms, and 6000–8000 kbps when you record in OBS. Higher bitrate and 60 fps make the phone warmer."
